                                    1845</bibl>.</note>
                        <lb/><ref xml:id="ea356d00-31de-4038-b56d-0031de603800" corresp="#d55e8a14-29fd-4bdd-9e8a-1429fd0bdd89" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0004221 http://d-nb.info/gnd/117241814">Jussieu</persName>
                                <lb/><choice>
